{"name":"Cold Snap","hex":"#acbac5","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cold snap","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A short and sudden period of cold weather."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cold_snap"}],"entries":[{"title":"Masters of Disaster (comics)","blocks":[{"text":"The Masters of Disaster are a team of supervillains appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics. They are a group of mercenary metahumans whose superhuman abilities correspond to a force of nature: earth, wind, fire, and water."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masters_of_Disaster_(comics)"},{"title":"Cold Snap (Albert Collins album)","blocks":[{"text":"Cold Snap is an album by the American blues musician Albert Collins, released in 1986. The album was nominated for a Grammy Award in the \"Best Traditional Blues Recording\" category. Collins supported the album with a North American tour."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a1/Cold_Snap_%28Albert_Collins_album%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cold_Snap_(Albert_Collins_album)"},{"title":"Cold Snap (Dexter: New Blood)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Cold Snap\" is the first episode of the American television miniseries Dexter: New Blood, a continuation of the series Dexter. The episode was written by series developer Clyde Phillips from a story by Phillips and Adam Rapp and directed by executive producer Marcos Siega. It originally aired on Showtime on November 7, 2021, being also available on its streaming service at midnight on the same day."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/51/Dexter_Morgan_in_%22Cold_Snap%22_New_Blood.png/330px-Dexter_Morgan_in_%22Cold_Snap%22_New_Blood.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cold_Snap_(Dexter%3A_New_Blood)"},{"title":"Cold wave","blocks":[{"text":"A cold wave is a weather phenomenon that is distinguished by a cooling of the air. Specifically, as used by the U.S. National Weather Service, a cold wave is a rapid fall in temperature within a 24-hour period requiring substantially increased protection to agriculture, industry, commerce, and social activities. The precise criteria for a cold wave are the rate at which the temperature falls, and the minimum to which it falls. This minimum temperature is dependent on the geographical region and time of year."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cold_wave"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg/500px-Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg/1280px-Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg/500px-Michael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Series star Michael C. Hall deemed the original series finale, \"mystifying at best.\"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMichael_C_Hall_at_SD_Comic_Con_2013.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Clyde_Phillips_at_53rd_Saturn_Awards_2026.jpg/500px-Clyde_Phillips_at_53rd_Saturn_Awards_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Clyde_Phillips_at_53rd_Saturn_Awards_2026.jpg/1280px-Clyde_Phillips_at_53rd_Saturn_Awards_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Clyde_Phillips_at_53rd_Saturn_Awards_2026.jpg/500px-Clyde_Phillips_at_53rd_Saturn_Awards_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Clyde Phillips returns as showrunner, a position he held for the first four seasons of the original series.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AClyde_Phillips_at_53rd_Saturn_Awards_2026.jpg"}],"sounds":{"cold snap":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/En-au-cold_snap.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5c/En-au-cold_snap.ogg/En-au-cold_snap.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"COLD SNAP","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/COLD_SNAP.jpg/500px-COLD_SNAP.jpg","ratio":1.7777777777777777,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:COLD_SNAP.jpg","share":0.286875},{"title":"Grey heron 2022 04 03 03","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Grey_heron_2022_04_03_03.jpg/500px-Grey_heron_2022_04_03_03.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_heron_2022_04_03_03.jpg","share":0.281875},{"title":"2022-12-24 16 08 32 Ice on a sidewalk during a severe cold snap along Lochatong Road in the Mountainview section of Ewing Township, Mercer County, New Jersey","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/2022-12-24_16_08_32_Ice_on_a_sidewalk_during_a_severe_cold_snap_along_Lochatong_Road_in_the_Mountainview_section_of_Ewing_Township%2C_Mercer_County%2C_New_Jersey.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2022-12-24_16_08_32_Ice_on_a_sidewalk_during_a_severe_cold_snap_along_Lochatong_Road_in_the_Mountainview_section_of_Ewing_Township,_Mercer_County,_New_Jersey.jpg","share":0.25625},{"title":"2022-12-26 14 37 06 Ice on a sidewalk after a severe cold snap along Forest Lane in the Mountainview secti